If the view is updatable — typically a single base table, no aggregates/DISTINCT/GROUP BY/set operators, and it includes all NOT NULL columns without defaults. Otherwise, use INSTEAD OF triggers (SQL Server, Oracle, PostgreSQL, SQLite).'), 'C'),
