Range	BETWEEN a AND b (inclusive)	hire_date BETWEEN ''2018-01-01'' AND ''2020-12-31''
List	IN (…), NOT IN (…)	dept_id IN (2, 3)
Pattern	LIKE, NOT LIKE	name LIKE ''A%''
Null test	IS NULL, IS NOT NULL	email IS NULL
